    EncodedSealFailed %GuiRgba8888RowTileRleEncodedSealErrorKind

impl Clone for GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRleEncodedSealErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRleEncodedSealErrorKind GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRleEncodedSealErrorKind \kind:
        *kind

impl Copy for GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRleEncodedSealErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRleEncodedSealErrorKind GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRleEncodedSealErrorKind \kind:
        kind

